    "operational_boundary": "The registry index publishes hash-oriented or minimized public proof commitments. It does not store tax codes, fiscal codes, document numbers, identity documents, identity scans, biometric material, private evidence, raw AI prompts, raw AI outputs, personal data, client files, regulated identity material, credentials, secrets, private keys, financial assets, internal endpoints, or sensitive operational payloads."
