  "description": "Public R&D registry index for minimized HBCE / IPR proof records and IPR AI Audit Trail references. The registry publishes hash-oriented or minimized public proof commitments and does not store tax codes, fiscal codes, document numbers, identity documents, credentials, secrets, private keys, raw AI prompts, raw AI outputs, client files, private evidence or sensitive operational payloads. If a required hash is absent, malformed, ambiguous or inconsistent, verification must return INVALID or NON_OPERATIONAL according to fail-closed rules.",
