  "privacy_note": "Public identity labels, operator labels, audit labels or node labels may appear only when intentionally published for attribution, registry readability and audit continuity. Tax codes, fiscal codes, document numbers, identity documents, identity document scans, private identity evidence, credentials, secrets, private keys, raw AI prompts, raw AI outputs, client files, production logs, internal endpoints and non-public payloads must not be stored in the public registry. Public hashes should represent minimized proof commitments rather than raw personal identifiers.",
